ChromaStick Schematic

Components:
- Raspberry Pi
- Raspberry Pi GPIO Extension Board
- 40-Pin Ribbon Cable
- Breadboard
- MCP3008 ADC Module
- Joystick Module
- RGB LED
- 3x 220 Ohm Resistors

Connections:
GPIO (SPI) -> MCP3008 ADC
MCP3008 CH0 -> Joystick X
MCP3008 CH1 -> Joystick Y
GPIO -> RGB LED Red
GPIO -> RGB LED Green
GPIO -> RGB LED Blue
Ground -> Common Ground
3.3V -> MCP3008 and Joystick

This project was prototyped on a breadboard using a Raspberry Pi, MCP3008 ADC, analog joystick module, and RGB LED.
